---
import { CONTENT } from "../site";

const { links, pricing } = CONTENT;
---

<section id="agendar" class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pb-28 text-center">
  <div
    class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[40px] border border-white/20 bg-gradient-to-b from-(--color-primary)/20 via-neutral-950 to-neutral-950 px-8 py-20 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-[0_0_80px_color-mix(in_oklab,var(--color-primary)_25%,transparent)]"
  >
    <div
      class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 left-1/2 h-72 w-72 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-(--color-primary)/30 blur-3xl"
    ></div>

    <p
      class="inline-block rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/15 px-4 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-(--color-primary) mb-4"
    >
      Tu próximo paso es simple
    </p>

    <h2
      class="font-sans mx-auto max-w-3xl text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white md:text-6xl"
    >
      Empezá hoy. <span class="text-(--color-primary)">Agendá tu consultoría gratuita.</span>
    </h2>

    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-base text-white/70">
      Sin llamadas ni idas y vueltas: elegís día y horario en 2 clics, te llega la
      confirmación y un recordatorio automático.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href={links.calendly}
        class="group relative inline-flex items-center gap-4 rounded-full bg-white/15 p-2 pl-8 pr-2 text-base font-bold tracking-wide text-white backdrop-blur-md border border-white/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-(--color-primary) hover:bg-white/25 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_color-mix(in_oklab,var(--color-primary)_50%,transparent)] hover:scale-105"
      >
        <span>{pricing.cta}</span>
        <span
          class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-(--color-primary) text-(--color-on-primary) transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:translate-x-1 shadow-[0_0_15px_color-mix(in_oklab,var(--color-primary)_70%,transparent)]"
        >
          <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
          </svg>
        </span>
      </a>
      <a
        href={links.whatsapp}
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white/90 backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/30 hover:bg-white/10"
      >
        <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path
            d="M12.04 2c-5.46 0-9.91 4.45-9.91 9.91 0 1.75.46 3.45 1.32 4.95L2.05 22l5.25-1.38c1.45.79 3.08 1.21 4.74 1.21 5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91 0-2.65-1.03-5.14-2.9-7.01A9.816 9.816 0 0012.04 2z"
          />
        </svg>
        <span>Escribime por WhatsApp</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>